{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_claims_size", "text": "FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章语料的声明（claims）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labeling", "text": "这些声明根据证据集被标注为 “SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES” 或 “NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "论文指出，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条声明，来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "这些声明根据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_fields", "text": "作者从 FEVER 数据集中收集所有声明及其“id”、“label”和“verifiable”字段。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c7c17ddf8a10b59543bbe5cd"}]}, {"key": "cloze_conversion", "text": "论文将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task，做法是掩蔽声明中提供的命名实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "cloze_accuracy", "text": "问题生成任务在将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task 时达到近 90% 的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "conversion_metric", "text": "转换准确率定义为抽取到命名实体的声明数与声明总数之比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "questions_per_claim", "text": "平均每条声明生成 3 个问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "classification_labels", "text": "目前分类器能够将声明分类为“SUPPORTS”和“MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "label_accuracy", "text": "该方法的标签准确率在转换数据集的开发集上为 80.2%，在测试集上为 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t3", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_unsupervised_size", "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》指出FEVER是最大的数据集，包含约185k条claim，语料库为5.4M篇Wikipedia文章。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_clinical_no_coverage", "text": "所给《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》的证据仅描述其使用Mayo Clinic的临床笔记和病理报告做临床信息抽取，未提及FEVER数据集，因此该论文未回答FEVER数据集有多大。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "uqafc_label_accuracy", "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》报告其在转换后数据集上的label accuracy为开发集80.2%、测试集80.25%；结论中表述为在“SUPPORTS”标签上达到80.2% label accuracy。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "uqafc_baseline_comparison", "text": "该论文将“SUPPORTS”标签的label accuracy与监督方法HexaF比较，称在其阈值φ=0.76时方法性能与HexaF相当；证据未给出相对基线的具体提升数值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "clinical_no_baseline_gain", "text": "所给《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》的证据仅泛泛提到深度表示学习可带来性能提升，并讨论了cTAKES特征工程耗时，但未给出其模型相对基线的具体提升幅度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "not_comparable", "text": "两篇论文的任务与评测对象不同（FEVER fact-checking标签准确率 vs 临床信息抽取），且临床论文证据未报告FEVER规模或具体提升数值，因此无法对“FEVER数据集大小”或“相对基线提升幅度”做可比对照。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
